# November 28, 2026: seventeen standing buildings in Detroit, Michigan (and one in Grosse Pointe Farms next door), taken
# from the names in one walk-through video of old Detroit buildings (Old World Exploration, "Old World Detroit"; the
# record is source/videos/20220523_pyXMlPDhK-U.md). The video is a tip only: every fact here comes from the sources
# linked on each place. Sources read: Wikipedia (one article at a time), the Michigan DNR's Belle Isle Park page, the
# Belle Isle Conservancy's front page, the Detroit Masonic Temple's tour page and the ArcGIS address geocoder.
from data_b import N
